WEBVTT

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:07.440
It looks like you've gotten used 
to living in the dorm, Kaos-sensei.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:08.290
Yes!

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:11.390
There are so many firsts that I've 
learned and experienced there,

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:14.530
so I think I'll be able to draw 
a lot of interesting manga.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:16.190
I see.

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:18.380
I'll go ahead and take a look, then.

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:21.830
Crêpes and
High School Girls

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:21.830
It's about to begin!

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:20.840
So the protagonists are high school girls?

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:21.840
Yes!

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:22.770
The other day,

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:27.170
I had this thing called a 
c-c-crêpe for the first time.

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:29.010
It was so amazing,

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:31.840
I thought it might be interesting 
to make a manga about it.

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:32.550
Good point.

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:36.080
Gourmet manga are pretty popular recently,

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:40.650
and having high school girls as the 
protagonists matches our reader base.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:44.210
And the fact that you're drawing the story as

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:45.980
Pshuu~

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:45.980
It melts in your mouth~

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:45.980
Minch
Minch

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:45.970
an actual high school girl is interesting.

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.210
I went with three other friends,

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:53.780
Chomp Chomp

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:53.780
So delicious

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:53.780
it melts in your mouth~

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:53.780
Nom Nom

00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:55.580
and the chocolate banana one that 
one of them got was so good!

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:57.910
So rich

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:57.910
So sweet

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:57.910
it melts in your mouth~

00:00:55.580 --> 00:01:00.620
Oh, but the double berry one 
that I got was good, too!

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:57.910
Minch
Minch

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:00.620
This is...

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:06.710
Yes! I thought up a manga where high school 
girls eat as many crêpes as they can!

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:10.820
She's definitely eating a lot of them...

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:13.900
I'm sorry, I have a question.

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:14.550
Yes?

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:29.400
So sweet it melts
in your mouth~

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:29.400
Minch Minch

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:17.520
What is this "minch minch" right here?

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:20.870
The sfx to express the chewy texture
you get when you eat a crêpe.

00:01:20.870 --> 00:01:22.350
And this "grunch grunch"?

00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:23.810
The sound of the corn flakes!

00:01:23.810 --> 00:01:25.130
In gourmet manga,

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:26.480
So rich~

00:01:25.130 --> 00:01:29.710
they have like "so rich" and 
"chomp chomp" and "pshuu."

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:27.980
Chomp Chomp

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:29.400
Pshuu~

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:31.900
Depicting sound effects
correctly is really important,

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:34.120
so I came up with some new ones.

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:37.110
It really melts in your mouth

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:37.110
Mufufufufu

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:37.110
Scruish Scruish Scruish Scruish Scruish

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:41.990
Please reconsider... the entire thing.

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:17.460
Today's Menu
Chicken Teriyaki
Agedashi Tofu 
Greens in Soy Sauce
Nameko mushroom soup

00:03:14.990 --> 00:03:17.460
What's wrong with it?

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:20.400
I think you've got the right idea.

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:25.560
Kaos-chan, your editor asked 
you to write about what actual

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:26.980
high school girls feel, right?

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:30.720
Yes, and I drew how I really felt.

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:34.140
What else did you think, other than
about it melting in your mouth?

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:35.300
Huh?

00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:36.530
It was sweet...

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:37.980
It was sweet, and?

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:40.560
And it melted in my mouth...

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:43.530
Like it was delicious and 
melted in my mouth...

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:47.280
And I felt so happy, and it melted in my mouth...

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:49.490
Now that I actually think about it,

00:03:49.490 --> 00:03:55.700
I might not know what real high school girls
are actually thinking...

00:03:55.700 --> 00:04:00.170
I'm surrounded by real high 
school girls every day,

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:02.900
and living an exciting and happy life...

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:04.260
So what am I doing wrong?

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:06.470
I think that's just the thing.

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:07.350
Huh?

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:10.130
When you talk about high school girls,

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:12.420
you make it sound like 
you don't relate to them.

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:14.300
Yeah, I can see that.

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:16.400
Like this protagonist's line here.

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:19.320
So cute! So cute! So cute! So cute! So cute! So cute! So cute!

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:19.320
High school
girls sure
love cute
things!

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:20.210
"High school girls sure love cute things!"

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:22.570
Have as
much as
you'd like
today!

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:23.650
And, "Eat as much as you'd like today!"

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:25.960
You almost sound like a dad.

00:04:25.960 --> 00:04:27.280
A dad?!

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:29.490
Also, Kaos-chan,

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:31.300
this page...

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:31.450
I'm just a
normal high
school
girl that
you'd find
anywhere.

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:31.450
I've
got
lots
of
friends!

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:33.750
Today,
I'm going
to the
city with
my friends.

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:33.750
Squee! Squee! Your face is so small! Blah Blah Crowds

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.960
There's cream
on my chest!!

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.960
Ah!

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.960
Plop

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:38.000
Ew, you pervert!

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:38.000
Thank you,
God!

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.500
This girl isn't normal!

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:40.830
What?!

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:45.600
Usually in a whipped cream situation, 
a girl wouldn't thank God!

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:47.850
R-Really?

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:50.490
Also, can I bring up one thing?

00:04:50.490 --> 00:04:52.560
S-Sure, go ahead, Koyume-chan.

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:54.020
It's too cute!

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:54.020
So fashionable!

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:54.020
Let's wear
the same one!

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:56.480
These clothes are so lame!

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:58.170
L-Lame?!

00:04:58.170 --> 00:04:59.810
They're not lame!

00:04:59.810 --> 00:05:02.610
Cats are cute, and English 
letters look awesome!

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.390
Kaos-chan,

00:05:04.390 --> 00:05:06.460
I've been wondering about this for a while,

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:09.340
but I think you're a little off...

00:05:09.340 --> 00:05:10.580
I mean, look at your clothes!

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:12.820
Now you're insulting me personally?!

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:14.500
Not to mention they're really ragged!

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:16.460
Let's throw them out and buy you new clothes!

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:17.930
If we can work on your own style,

00:05:17.930 --> 00:05:20.450
you'll be able to make
your characters more likable, too.

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:24.550
My grandma made me these clothes...

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:27.540
I can't throw them out...

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:28.540
<i>Huh?</i>

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:31.060
<i>Despite looking lame, her likability 
just shot through the roof!</i>

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:35.430
Actually, I could never figure out when 
you're supposed to get rid of clothes,

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:39.320
and since I never grow, 
I can wear the same ones forever...

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:41.780
Sorry, Kaos-chan...

00:05:41.780 --> 00:05:45.780
But I still think you should 
dress differently sometimes!

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:47.360
You always have your hair in a braid,

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:49.600
but why don't you try chopping it off?

00:05:48.340 --> 00:05:49.590
No!

00:05:50.470 --> 00:05:54.090
My long hair is the one solid piece 
of evidence that I've actually grown!

00:05:54.090 --> 00:05:57.040
I mean, I haven't grown any 
taller since fourth grade...

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:58.440
<i>So sad!</i>

00:05:58.440 --> 00:06:00.550
<i>Everything out of her mouth is so sad!</i>

00:06:00.550 --> 00:06:03.890
Th-Then why don't we try 
changing up your hairstyle?

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:10.800
Your hair is so fluffy!

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:17.170
That tickles!

00:06:17.170 --> 00:06:18.800
You need to stay still!

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:24.900
<i>Thank you, God!</i>

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:26.400
Don't thank God!

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:27.610
Oh, right!

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:31.940
All done!

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:37.210
You're so cute, Kaos-chan!

00:06:37.210 --> 00:06:38.620
You're perfect!

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:38.620
Hurgh!

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:41.540
And the fashion that goes 
with this hairstyle...

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:48.420
So lovely!

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:51.090
How about a sporty-looking Kaos-chan?

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:52.860
That's cute, too!

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:56.260
Try my clothes on, too.

00:06:57.550 --> 00:06:59.520
You look good in cool-style fashion, too.

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:02.500
Now all she needs is a backpack!

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:03.980
And maybe one of those little yellow hats.

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:09.190
S-So I really do look 
like a grade-schooler...

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:11.080
W-We're kidding...

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:13.850
Yeah. It's not like we 
actually have a backpack.

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:17.360
There's a backpack in the reference room.

00:07:18.470 --> 00:07:20.820
I knew it!

00:07:20.820 --> 00:07:23.500
You look amazing, Kaos-chan!

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:28.800
<i>This isn't very high school girl-like at all!</i>

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:37.690
I-I'm sorry that I even flashed you 
with my lame panties just now...

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:39.880
W-We didn't say anything.

00:07:39.880 --> 00:07:40.560
Nope.

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:43.790
More importantly, who cares if they're lame?

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:44.570
It's your style.

00:07:44.570 --> 00:07:45.590
Huh?

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:50.240
This has plenty of potential that makes 
it look like it'll be interesting.

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:52.320
Tsubasa-san...

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:54.180
But in your case,

00:07:54.180 --> 00:07:57.200
the thing you'll have to work 
on most is your art.

00:07:57.430 --> 00:08:01.910
The most important thing about gourmet 
manga is to make food look delicious,

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:03.250
but that's not how yours look at all.

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:05.700
Not to mention, the art looks 
the same in every panel,

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:06.830
and the story is monotonous.

00:08:07.110 --> 00:08:10.090
You can't even tell the characters apart.

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:12.930
That wasn't carrot-and-stick,
that was just stick-and-stick.

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:14.690
I-I-I'm so sorry...

00:08:14.690 --> 00:08:16.970
My storyboard is indeed trash...

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:21.290
It's not even worth the first 
letter of the word "trash"...

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:23.300
I'm trying to tell you you're 
just getting started.

00:08:26.720 --> 00:08:27.920
You're just getting started.

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:35.520
I heard that sketching is a good 
way to improve your art skills.

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:37.850
Sketching?

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:39.190
I know!

00:08:39.190 --> 00:08:41.330
Why don't we have a sketching contest?

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:42.740
That's a good idea.

00:08:44.110 --> 00:08:47.760
You're all... doing this all for me...

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:56.740
Let's do our best!

00:08:56.740 --> 00:08:57.910
Yes!

00:08:57.910 --> 00:09:02.770
<i>I missed my chance to ask 
her to wear this next...</i>

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:04.980
Episode 3
"Jiggle Jiggle Bounce"

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:04.980
Meow

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:04.980
Abaa

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:04.980
A bunny,
a kitty and
a birdie...

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:13.540
I ended up getting out later than I thought, 
doing daily duties at scho— Argh!

00:09:14.010 --> 00:09:15.870
I'm home.

00:09:17.140 --> 00:09:18.940
Welcome back.

00:09:18.940 --> 00:09:20.450
Look, Kaos-chan.

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:22.130
I made her a little hat.

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:27.360
It's so cute!

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:29.370
She looks like a manga artist!

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:31.740
So her name would be Nyaos-sensei.

00:09:31.740 --> 00:09:32.940
Nyaos!

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:34.660
It looks like Ruki-chan and Koyume-chan

00:09:34.660 --> 00:09:37.350
have already started the sketching contest.

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:39.380
Right.

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:46.210
Meow, meow, Nyaos-chan!

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:49.260
Nyaos-chan!

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:52.110
Wait, I can't do that...

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:55.690
It's okay. You can do this, Koyume-chan.

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:58.530
Th-This is...

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:21.680
Oh, Kaos-chan.

00:10:25.730 --> 00:10:27.700
I-I interrupted!

00:10:27.700 --> 00:10:29.550
I'm so sorry!

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:32.000
Don't get the wrong idea, Kaos-chan!

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:34.070
I was just asking Koyume-chan to pose for me!

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:35.130
Right?!

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:37.410
Yes.

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:41.290
I was just doing whatever 
Ruki-chan wanted me to.

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:43.700
Don't say it like that!

00:10:49.390 --> 00:10:53.840
Koyume-chan's figure is perfect for my manga.

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:55.470
Woohoo!

00:10:58.510 --> 00:11:00.160
That's not right!

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:02.260
I need you to look more embarrassed!

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:03.460
What?

00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:07.240
Are you not able to get into the 
mood because you're by yourself?

00:11:07.240 --> 00:11:10.350
Kaos-chan, could you be 
Koyume-chan's partner?

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:12.560
Uh... Okay!

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:16.620
Try holding Koyume-chan from behind.

00:11:17.590 --> 00:11:19.030
L-Like this?!

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:22.240
More desperately! Like really cling onto her!

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:23.280
Okay!

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:30.370
Ba-dump

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:30.370
She ended up piggyback riding her...

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:33.460
<i>I need them to pose like they're lovers.</i>

00:11:34.640 --> 00:11:38.920
<i>Kaos-chan and Koyume-chan 
definitely don't look like lovers.</i>

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:40.500
I know! I'll get Tsu-chan—

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:41.760
No!

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:45.170
I don't want Tsubasa-san to see me like this!

00:11:43.820 --> 00:11:45.910
That's it! That's the expression!

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:47.400
I'm really getting into it now!

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:48.850
M-Me, too!

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:55.280
It really is different when 
you actually have a model.

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:57.980
Compared to drawing from imagination,
this is so much more...

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:12.290
<i>We're on completely different levels!</i>

00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:17.110
How can I learn
to draw so realistically?

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:21.700
You use a lot of straight 
lines in your drawings.

00:12:21.700 --> 00:12:23.540
Try adding more curves.

00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:24.900
Curves...

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:28.370
Look closer at Koyume-chan.

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:29.180
Okay.

00:12:30.050 --> 00:12:32.890
Her shoulders are curvy.

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:34.350
Yes, yes.

00:12:34.680 --> 00:12:37.810
Her tummy looks really jiggly, too.

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:40.020
You're right.

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:42.980
Her butt looks really bouncy, too.

00:12:42.980 --> 00:12:44.740
So basically, jiggle, jiggle, bounce!

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:46.240
That's so mean!

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:48.900
I've been so worried about 
gaining weight lately!

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:50.370
Then why don't you stop eating so much?

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:51.330
No!

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:52.790
You have boobs,

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:54.930
so what's wrong with being a little chubby!

00:12:54.930 --> 00:12:55.620
You're asking too much!

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:58.220
It's not like I'm happy about that.

00:12:58.220 --> 00:12:59.800
They just grow on their own.

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:01.120
Grow on their own?!

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:04.780
You mean you don't eat a lot of 
soybeans or drink a lot of milk?

00:13:04.780 --> 00:13:06.960
I only eat sweets.

00:13:06.960 --> 00:13:10.140
No exercises to make them bigger, 
or massages, or praying...

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:11.340
You're not doing anything?!

00:13:11.340 --> 00:13:12.700
Ruki-chan...

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:15.190
Who cares?!

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:17.320
You have a small waist,

00:13:17.320 --> 00:13:19.560
long arms and legs, 
and your hair is silky smooth!

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:21.750
You're basically right out of a shojo manga!

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:23.870
No fair! Ruki-chan, you idiot!

00:13:23.870 --> 00:13:25.840
G-Girls that are actually 
popular in real life

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:28.510
are aloof and cute girls 
like you, Koyume-chan!

00:13:28.510 --> 00:13:29.570
You idiot!

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:31.760
That's not true, stupid!

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:33.530
You're the one that's stupid, Koyume-chan!

00:13:33.530 --> 00:13:34.740
Wh-What should I do?

00:13:34.740 --> 00:13:39.590
Stupid! Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!

00:13:34.980 --> 00:13:36.900
<i>I should stop their fighting,</i>

00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:39.580
<i>but this is really cute, 
so I want to keep watching.</i>

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:41.340
All the popular girls in manga

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:44.280
are the ones with big breasts!

00:13:44.280 --> 00:13:47.100
Everyone likes big-chested girls!

00:13:47.100 --> 00:13:49.030
Ruki-san, that's not true!

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:52.730
True, breasts are important...

00:13:52.730 --> 00:13:54.560
But what's more important...

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:57.520
is a girl looking embarrassed 
about her chest size!

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:02.630
That's what makes us... Makes us...

00:14:02.630 --> 00:14:03.730
Who is "us"?

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:06.120
Kaos-chan, you're basically 
on the same side as me,

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:07.610
so you understand, don't you?

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:08.550
No.

00:14:08.550 --> 00:14:11.850
My breasts aren't a matter 
of small or large...

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:14.030
they basically won't grow any more,

00:14:14.030 --> 00:14:17.620
so I could never join 
in on your conversation.

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:19.220
Don't give up!

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:21.360
You're still growing, Kaos-chan!

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:23.170
So you can't give up!

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:24.210
Huh?

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:36.440
I'm sorry, Kaos-chan...

00:14:36.720 --> 00:14:39.060
All because I left my tea there.

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:40.280
It's okay.

00:14:40.280 --> 00:14:44.010
The tea basically went straight down 
like water running against a flat board.

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:45.200
Now, now...

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:48.490
This just means everyone has insecurities, 
whether their chest is big or small.

00:14:48.690 --> 00:14:50.690
Normal is best.

00:14:50.690 --> 00:14:52.700
A C cup is ideal.

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:56.210
That's about the size where you 
look good in both cute and cool clothing,

00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:57.550
so it's perfect.

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:03.360
Oh, did you already start the 
sketching contest?

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:04.960
That's perfect!

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:05.740
Huh?

00:15:05.740 --> 00:15:08.210
Wh-Wh-Wh-What's wrong, Tsubasa-san?

00:15:08.210 --> 00:15:11.170
Why did you take off, off, off...

00:15:11.170 --> 00:15:14.090
Kaos-chan, you're sounding 
like a weirdo again...

00:15:14.090 --> 00:15:16.630
Oh, I didn't have an umbrella.

00:15:16.630 --> 00:15:18.090
She just dodged the comment!

00:15:18.090 --> 00:15:19.810
More importantly,

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:24.050
I hadn't noticed in a while, but your 
figure has gotten really nice, Tsu-chan.

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:25.310
What do you mean?

00:15:25.310 --> 00:15:27.440
You're fit in all the right places.

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:28.520
You look lovely!

00:15:28.520 --> 00:15:30.190
What? I don't get it.

00:15:36.100 --> 00:15:38.640
You need to be at least this muscular,

00:15:38.640 --> 00:15:40.980
or you fail as a hero of darkness.

00:15:42.450 --> 00:15:44.200
Tsu-chan, Tsu-chan,

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:45.970
being that muscular is a bit...

00:15:45.970 --> 00:15:47.330
No, this is perfect.

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:49.650
Um, I don't know if I could 
even be your friend...

00:15:49.650 --> 00:15:51.100
No, this is perfect.

00:15:51.100 --> 00:15:52.780
It would feel really weird hugging you.

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:53.470
This is perfect.

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:05.290
<i>Ruki-san's sketch and Tsubasa-san's doodle...</i>

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:07.950
<i>They were drawn so quickly 
and looked really good.</i>

00:16:08.720 --> 00:16:12.420
<i>She's the same age as me and 
has already published books...</i>

00:16:12.890 --> 00:16:14.600
<i>I need to work harder...</i>

00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:17.270
You're working so hard, Kaos-chan.

00:16:18.480 --> 00:16:20.490
It's snack time.

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:24.450
Thank you, Koyume-chan.

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:08.560
Kaos-chan and Koyume-chan 
seem to be running late.

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:10.110
Maybe they overslept.

00:17:10.110 --> 00:17:11.290
I'll go wake them up.

00:17:13.270 --> 00:17:14.390
Goomoafternight.

00:17:14.390 --> 00:17:17.600
Kaos-chan, Koyume-chan, 
why don't we have some breakfast?

00:17:25.840 --> 00:17:26.820
What happened?!

00:17:26.820 --> 00:17:29.840
Oh, no! Kaos-chan's barely conscious!

00:17:29.840 --> 00:17:33.720
Soft serve is so yummy!

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:36.170
I knew it...

00:17:37.520 --> 00:17:40.350
You didn't even notice how 
you were doing physically?

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:41.530
Weren't you eating?

00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:44.930
We both remembered snack time, but...

00:17:45.550 --> 00:17:48.880
Thanks, but I'm not hungry right now...

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:50.550
Then I'll eat it for you.

00:17:50.550 --> 00:17:52.490
<i>So she hasn't eaten!</i>

00:17:52.490 --> 00:17:54.570
S-Sorry, Kaos-chan!

00:17:54.570 --> 00:17:57.170
It's not your fault, Koyume-chan.

00:17:57.170 --> 00:18:00.910
I was so busy fixing my 
storyboard that I couldn't eat.

00:18:00.910 --> 00:18:02.500
For the gourmet manga?

00:18:02.500 --> 00:18:05.580
Yes. Since I don't really understand gourmet,

00:18:05.580 --> 00:18:07.760
I don't really deserve to eat.

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:09.220
But you'll die!

00:18:09.220 --> 00:18:10.450
Kaos-chan,

00:18:10.450 --> 00:18:15.810
you won't be able to continue being 
a manga artist if you get sick.

00:18:15.810 --> 00:18:18.200
Make sure you eat the dorm 
meals, starting today.

00:18:18.770 --> 00:18:20.340
Is there anything you can't eat?

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:22.400
N-No.

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:24.560
T-Tomatoes...

00:18:26.920 --> 00:18:28.660
Broccoli...

00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:32.330
N-Natto...

00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:40.020
You lied! There are plenty 
of things you don't like!

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:47.300
I... have no right to dislike food.

00:18:51.720 --> 00:18:53.480
It's delicious.

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:56.200
This looks good, too.

00:18:57.200 --> 00:18:59.650
It's all really delicious...

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:02.890
You're lying! You haven't 
swallowed any of it!

00:19:07.300 --> 00:19:09.040
I'm sorry, Miharu.

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:13.480
One of the girls has a fever, 
so I won't be able to go out tonight.

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:15.400
<i>Oh, no worries.</i>

00:19:15.400 --> 00:19:17.400
<i>I hope she feels better soon.</i>

00:19:18.230 --> 00:19:20.730
She's a really hard worker.

00:19:20.730 --> 00:19:22.260
<i>Tell her to take care.</i>

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:24.390
<i>I'll let Mayu know you had to cancel.</i>

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:27.000
Thanks. I'll talk to you later.

00:19:29.110 --> 00:19:31.430
Now for the other matter...

00:19:52.320 --> 00:19:53.580
Kaos-chan!

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:54.820
How are you feeling?

00:19:54.820 --> 00:19:55.670
Do you still have a fever?

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:57.770
I think it finally came down.

00:19:57.770 --> 00:20:00.720
We thought you might be able to eat these.

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:02.590
Mixed
Vegetable Chips

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:02.590
They're good!

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:05.410
Did you sweat much? Want to get changed?

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:08.180
I didn't know what would work, but...

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:12.540
They say that good and bad 
health start in the mind!

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:14.400
You're going to defeat the sickness?

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:15.190
You go, Tsuba!

00:20:17.240 --> 00:20:19.300
Th-Thank you very much.

00:20:21.500 --> 00:20:25.300
Kaos-chan, do you think you 
could eat a little dinner?

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:30.510
Th-Thank you for the meal.

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:32.560
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:35.500
<i>I'm still not very hungry...</i>

00:20:40.220 --> 00:20:41.590
It's good.

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:43.110
Somehow, this is really soothing.

00:20:43.110 --> 00:20:44.120
Is it?

00:20:44.120 --> 00:20:47.760
I called your parents' house and 
asked them for some pointers.

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:49.220
Huh?

00:20:50.900 --> 00:20:53.640
I'm so glad you ate.

00:20:54.880 --> 00:20:58.320
If you miss food from home, just let me know, okay?

00:20:58.320 --> 00:20:59.890
I'll do my best.

00:21:04.290 --> 00:21:05.920
Housemother...

00:21:06.690 --> 00:21:10.620
Oh, and I made a salad with plenty 
of soybeans for you, Ruki-chan.

00:21:10.620 --> 00:21:14.370
Why did you have to ruin the moment?!

00:21:16.970 --> 00:21:19.840
Are you all better now, Kaos-sensei?

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:22.440
I'm sorry that I made you worry,

00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:24.340
but I'm all better now!

00:21:24.340 --> 00:21:26.630
I redid my storyboard,

00:21:26.630 --> 00:21:28.480
incorporating the advice 
you gave me the other day.

00:21:29.110 --> 00:21:30.420
I'll take a look.

00:21:30.420 --> 00:21:33.180
When I thought about what's 
 popular right now,

00:21:33.180 --> 00:21:35.360
I realized it was making inanimate 
objects anthropomorphic!

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:38.780
True, that is its own genre.

00:21:38.780 --> 00:21:42.820
That's why I thought it could 
be done with crêpes, too.

00:21:43.520 --> 00:21:48.320
But I somehow wanted to keep high 
school girls and gourmet in it, so...

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:50.330
I got eaten.

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:50.330
Chomp

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:50.330
Chomp

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:50.330
It melts in your mouth~

00:21:48.800 --> 00:21:50.330
I thought about it really hard...

00:21:52.280 --> 00:21:55.720
Kaos-sensei, this storyboard...

00:21:55.720 --> 00:21:56.700
Yes?

00:21:56.700 --> 00:21:58.200
...is definitely not approved.

00:23:30.490 --> 00:23:31.920
"You can do anything, right?"

00:23:30.970 --> 00:23:31.920
No!

00:23:31.920 --> 00:23:33.330
"This is embarrassing!"

00:23:34.180 --> 00:23:36.430
"You're not allowed to see this, Kaos-chan!"

00:23:36.430 --> 00:23:39.590
Next time, "Scuffling Wildly Rendezvous."

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:39.930
Next Time

00:23:37.470 --> 00:23:39.930
Scuffling Wildly

00:23:38.310 --> 00:23:39.930
Rendezvous
